# Google target account confirmation (mandatory)

Before any write operation to Google services, the agent must explicitly confirm the target account with the user unless the user already specified it in the same request.

Applies to all Google outputs:
- Google Docs
- Google Sheets / Spreadsheets
- Google Slides
- Google Drive files/folders
- Any other Google artifact created or uploaded through MCP/API/scripts

Required flow:
1. Ask user target account (`personal` or `work`) if not explicitly stated.
2. Verify active OAuth account identity (email) via MCP/API before write.
3. If active account does not match selected target, stop and request re-auth.
4. Only then create/upload/update the artifact.

Do not silently write to whichever account is currently authorized.
